{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034670/extras/565403cbaf5a68ae99033fc7ee536b08.webp?t=1763486329\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034670/extras/565403cbaf5a68ae99033fc7ee536b08.poster.avif?t=1763486329\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=150 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've been captured and enslaved by the Facility and tasked with retrieving blood from overgrown brains from the depths of an ancient megastructure, but you may not be alone down there... Will you accept your fate, or find a way to escape? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abrasion is a first-person horror game set inside a brutal, skyless, megastructure. It takes around 90 minutes to complete. The world is filled with useful items, environmental storytelling, and many secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A dynamic, stalking AI monster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > An interconnected world full of hidden passages and secret areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Diverse items and tools to help you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Deep worldbuilding enhanced by intricately designed visuals and audio.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > An unsettling story told through the game's environments.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Escape","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3034670/1531b64e4a07fdec97700fd8bc297bab07c4c76c.jpg"},{"name":"Oilborn","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3034670/7ecfc5676aac6da0585747e90d824c762baf8e52.jpg"},{"name":"Hideout","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3034670/efe44744b49c6f7fe1be4cd7ea85839be3493315.jpg"},{"name":"Caught ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3034670/9d86a1fac4c39cb14eaf83acff89bc470e7890c1.jpg"},{"name":"Descend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3034670/adb930ca3691cf01583faa8de18a717b1ca1a58b.jpg"},{"name":"Secret route to area 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3034670/efe44744b49c6f7fe1be4cd7ea85839be3493315.jpg"},{"name":"Crowbar","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3034670/01abc07c8a750c49489f290404e45476a26a3530.jpg"},{"name":"The climb","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3034670/efe44744b49c6f7fe1be4cd7ea85839be3493315.jpg"},{"name":"Silo","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3034670/efe44744b49c6f7fe1be4cd7ea85839be3493315.jpg"},{"name":"Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3034670/72b845d4237e129ba4ed3f5ed0a80db341d8177d.jpg"}],"total":11},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3034670?t=1763486329","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3034670?t=1763486329","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034670/875f776341fe4490b019999e17f2a9193b62c9c7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763486329","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034670/875f776341fe4490b019999e17f2a9193b62c9c7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763486329","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Intended for Mature Audiences \u2013 Contains disturbing themes and intense moments.\r\n\r\nA relentless stalking entity that chases the player through environments. High-tension escape sequences with limited resources.\r\nDecaying corpses and unsettling biological growths.\r\nBlood stains.\r\nBrutalist megastructure with oppressive, claustrophobic spaces.\r\nPsychological dread: Flickering lights, distant whispers, and unpredictable sound design.\r\nEnvironmental storytelling with implied violence and tragic lore.\r\nSyringe-based mechanics (extracting fluids from grotesque organisms).\r\nJump Scares.\r\nRare, but impactful audio/visual shocks (e.g., sudden bangs, machinery activating)."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034670/extras/565403cbaf5a68ae99033fc7ee536b08.webp?t=1763486329\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034670/extras/565403cbaf5a68ae99033fc7ee536b08.poster.avif?t=1763486329\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=150 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've been captured and enslaved by the Facility and tasked with retrieving blood from overgrown brains from the depths of an ancient megastructure, but you may not be alone down there... Will you accept your fate, or find a way to escape? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abrasion is a first-person horror game set inside a brutal, skyless, megastructure. It takes around 90 minutes to complete. The world is filled with useful items, environmental storytelling, and many secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A dynamic, stalking AI monster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > An interconnected world full of hidden passages and secret areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Diverse items and tools to help you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Deep worldbuilding enhanced by intricately designed visuals and audio.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > An unsettling story told through the game's environments.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Studio Laaya"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034670/90cb06a70aacdbc7b5ddb98d3e7c3cb6cf312c2b/header.jpg?t=1763486329","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3034670/1877550601/d82350bf987e2a3401dd12b1a8c904e950a81397/1750146716/dash_av1.mpd?t=1750164183","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3034670/1877550601/d82350bf987e2a3401dd12b1a8c904e950a81397/1750146716/dash_h264.mpd?t=1750164183","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3034670/1877550601/d82350bf987e2a3401dd12b1a8c904e950a81397/1750146716/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1750164183","id":257157681,"name":"Abrasion Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257157681/6ad8af5aa20bdc42cbb6616d1d2b432dbdf6dd8a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1750164183"}],"name":"Abrasion","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Abrasion - $7.99 USD","packageid":1078883,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":799}],"title":"Buy Abrasion"}],"packages":[1078883],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 GHz dual core or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><str